                        "desc": "Log in to your 6thStreet account."
                      },
                      {
                        "id": 2,
                        "desc": "Navigate to My Account > Price Assurance > Raise a Request."
                      },
                      {
                        "id": 3,
                        "desc": "Select the product, enter the lower price, upload a screenshot, and provide the product link."
                      },
                      {
                        "id": 4,
                        "desc": "Our team will review the request. If approved, the difference will be credited to your My Cash within 48 hours."
                      },
                      {
                        "id": 5,
                        "desc": "You can track the status under My Account > Price Assurance > Past Requests."
